  "text": "Agnoman is a hero of the Book of Invasions of Ireland. He never reached Ireland himself. His son Nemed founded a people, the Nemedians, who went from the old home in Scythia to take Ireland. Some readers see in the tale what remains of a lost history. The poet Edmund Spenser read the tale as plain truth.",
